Subject: [PATCH 1/6] test(od-sevev): add mobile-first layout check and layout
 calculator

tools/web/mobile_web.mjs plays the web build at every phone of the
mobile matrix and the desktop frame, asserting the canvas fill and
integer scale (baseline) and the mobile-first layout rules (spec):
the vertical split, the safe-bottom tab bar, dead bands, fluid width,
the paged ticker and the bottom-anchored picker grid.
ux/tools/mobile_layout.py is the reference calculator for the
per-device numbers.

