Subject: [PATCH 2/6] docs(od-sevev): add mobile-first wireframes and the reach
 guard

ux/tools/mobile_mockup.py draws today's layout against the spec's at
390, 430, 360 and the SE, and the leader picker. The split rule keeps
the leader's hit bottom at 40% of the height or lower on the screen.

